        "tab_4nBwqY": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "navigation_title": "Why Choose Us",
            "tab_content": "<h4><strong>Science First, Always.</strong>​​</h4><p>With over 25 years of healthcare research behind us, Salvarity is built on the foundation of proven ingredients — no hype, no harsh anti-aging actives. Just what your skin actually needs.​​</p><p>Our ingredients are carefully screened and validated for safety, quality, and effectiveness — so every formula is built to support healthy-looking skin with proven care you can trust.​​</p><h4>#SkinSaviour Proven.​​</h4><p>Salvarity’s formulas are light, fast-absorbing, and easy to use — with results you can see and feel. Whether you're managing sensitivity, oiliness, or breakouts, our approach to Australian skincare delivers calm, balanced skin without the stress or confusion.​​</p><h4><strong>Planet-Conscious by Design.</strong>​​</h4><p>From biodegradable formulas to recyclable packaging, sustainability is part of every step. Proudly Australian-made, our products, labs, and Research Parks embody clean innovation — where science meets nature, and we build a healthier future for your skin and the planet. ​​</p><h4><strong>Clean & Safe, Without Compromise.</strong>​​</h4><p>We leave out the usual harsh ingredients and swap in cleaner, more sustainable alternatives — no fillers, no fluff. Just safe, effective Australian skincare that works in harmony with your skin.​​</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "tab_page": "",
            "enable_collapsible_tab": false,
